WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.700
Before your next client project starts,
answer three questions.

00:03.700 --> 00:06.100
What exactly will you deliver?

00:06.100 --> 00:08.200
When will the client receive the work?

00:08.200 --> 00:10.300
And who gives final approval?

00:10.300 --> 00:14.300
Put those answers in a short brief
and review them together.
